<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-Copesul still a Fator hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Copesul still a Fator hold.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fator Securities said it was maintaining its long-term hold rating on Brazilian petrochemical firm Copesul.</p>
<p>-- but said the stock could appreciate 15 percent by year-end.</p>
<p>-- Copesul shares were off 0.33 percent at 45 reais earlier on the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
